    "html":  "\u003cdiv class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan typeof=\"mw:File\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/8/8e/NanashiQBULB.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20240713022003\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"NanashiQBULB\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"1039\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"NanashiQBULB.jpg\" data-image-key=\"NanashiQBULB.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/8/8e/NanashiQBULB.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20240713022003\" /\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e \n\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cb\u003eNameless Warrior\u003c/b\u003e\n\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eA company employee who dies from overwork, Nanashi Tadano finds herself reborn in a world similar to her favorite anime, Queen\u0027s Blade Legend! Unexceptedly gaining the power of a legendary monster, she becomes the Beautiful Warrior Nanashi although she doesn\u0027t care for battles and just wants to watch her favorite warriors duel up close.\n\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eNanako Tata, who died from overwork while working at a black company, has been reincarnated as a beautiful warrior.\n\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eShe has made a contract with the legendary demon Melona, ​​who had been sealed away, and possesses the skill of \"Thousand Transformations,\" giving her the ability to transform her right arm into any weapon or creature.\n\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAs a huge fan of the beautiful warriors who appeared in the anime, she is thoroughly enjoying her reincarnated life where she can meet them up close.\n\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"69a4107aa5ffaebad93bb91b8e8f99b6\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"NanashiSQBULB-jpg\" style=\"position: relative; height:185px; width:72px;\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:NanashiSQBULB.jpg\" title=\"NanashiSQBULB.jpg (398 KB)\" style=\"height:185px; width:72px;\"\u003e\u003cnoscript\u003e\u003cimg style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/1/1c/NanashiSQBULB.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/72?cb=20240713022255\" title=\"NanashiSQBULB.jpg (398 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"NanashiSQBULB.jpg\" data-image-key=\"NanashiSQBULB.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\"\u003e\u003c/noscript\u003e\u003cimg style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"NanashiSQBULB.jpg (398 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"NanashiSQBULB.jpg\" data-image-key=\"NanashiSQBULB.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/1/1c/NanashiSQBULB.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/72?cb=20240713022255\" /\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Nanashi_NlW_Fangirl_Swimsuit_Queen-s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_-jpg\" style=\"position: relative; height:184px; width:76px; top:0.5px;\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Nanashi_NlW_Fangirl_Swimsuit_Queen%27s_B